msgstr "ការបម្លែងនឹងបញ្ឈប់បន្ទាប់ពីឯកសារបច្ចុប្បន្ន"

#: src/globalPlugins/easyAudioConverter/__init__.py:3042
msgid "The converted output was kept, but the source file could not be removed."
msgstr "The converted output was kept, but the source file could not be removed."

#: src/globalPlugins/easyAudioConverter/__init__.py:2286
msgid "The file does not contain valid conversion profiles."
msgstr "ឯកសារមិនមានប្រវត្តិការបម្លែងត្រឹមត្រូវទេ។"

#: src/globalPlugins/easyAudioConverter/__init__.py:475
msgid "The first AAC audio stream will be remuxed into M4A without re-encoding. Sources whose first audio stream is not AAC are skipped."
msgstr "ស្ទ្រីមសំឡេង AAC ដំបូងនឹងត្រូវបានប្ដូរទៅ M4A ដោយមិនចាំបាច់បំលែងឡើងវិញ។ ប្រភពសំឡេងដំបូងដែលមិនមែន AAC ត្រូវបានរំលង។"

#: src/globalPlugins/easyAudioConverter/__init__.py:3066
msgid "The first audio stream is not AAC, so it cannot be remuxed to M4A"
msgstr "ស្ទ្រីមសំឡេងដំបូងមិនមែនជា AAC ទេ ដូច្នេះវាមិនអាចប្ដូរទៅ M4A បានទេ។"

#: src/globalPlugins/easyAudioConverter/__init__.py:469
msgid "The first audio stream will be extracted without re-encoding. Its codec and quality remain unchanged, and the output extension is selected automatically."
